cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Promised vs. Produced Tracker"
abstract: >-
  America's biggest factory promises since 2017, followed until they produce.
  For each promised U.S. factory of at least $1 billion or 2,000 direct jobs:
  the announced capital, jobs and date of first output, next to the actual date
  of first output and the current status, each with a public source checked by
  a person.
